# Deny generated directories by default.  This audit workspace writes every
# compiler tree, replay trajectory, finite-difference perturbation, and ad hoc
# run into a top-level directory.  The independently authored release files
# are deliberately kept at the top level and enumerated in RELEASE_FILES.txt.
# Curated immutable evidence belongs under ../tapenade_toolchain/results/ with
# an explicit provenance manifest; it must not be committed from this tree.
/*/

# Machine-generated command summaries can also appear as top-level files.
*_console.json
*_stdout.json

# Python cache files.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
